Z||000000||GTMike||06-28-2001||02:40 AM||||my goal is to be able to run 13s 1/4   without nos.  <P>price is a big factor.<P>what is more expensive.  and what will give me more power.   a turbo kit with around 7 pounds of boost.  or swaping in a 3800 sc.<P>how much do trubo kits cost.  wich  is harder to install a turbo or an engien swap.  which one cost more to do.  i will be doing all the work myself.     a newer engine would cost around 2 grand.  and the kit to install it cost around the same totaling over 4 grand.  could i install a turbo for under 2 grand?  <P>dose anyone have any links to fiero turbo sites??   <P>sorry this is soo long<BR> thanks||||reg||1
